{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04776","headline":"岳州别梁六入朝 · 张说","name":"岳州别梁六入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远莅长沙渚，欣逢贾谊才。\n江山疲应接，风日复晴开。\n江树云间断，湘山水上来。\n近洲朝鹭集，古戍夜猿哀。\n岸杼含苍捄，河蒲秀紫台。\n月余偏地赏，心尽故人杯。\n自我违京洛，嗟君此泝洄。\n容华因别老，交旧与年颓。\n梦见长安陌，朝宗实盛哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}